{"seq":1,"slug":"photoelectric-effect","title":"光电效应","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/albert-einstein/major-works/quantum-and-statistical/photoelectric-effect","wordCount":1457,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"光电效应\">光电效应</h1><p>1905 年 3 月，爱因斯坦投出了奇迹年的第一篇论文：《关于光的产生和转化的一个启发性观点》。他自己称这篇论文&quot;非常革命性&quot;——在四篇奇迹年论文中，唯独这一篇被他如此形容。十六年后，正是这项关于光电效应的工作，而非相对论，为他赢得了诺贝尔奖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>光电效应指光照射到金属表面时把电子打出的现象。爱因斯坦提出，光在与物质交换能量时表现为一份份&quot;光量子&quot;，由此解释了波动理论无法说明的实验事实。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[光照射金属表面] --&gt; B[光由能量子组成 E=hf]&#10;    B --&gt; C{光子能量 hf 是否大于逸出功 W}&#10;    C --&gt;|是| D[电子逸出, 产生光电流]&#10;    C --&gt;|否| E[无论光多强都无电子逸出]&#10;    D --&gt; F[电子最大动能 = hf - W]\">flowchart TD\n    A[光照射金属表面] --&gt; B[光由能量子组成 E=hf]\n    B --&gt; C{光子能量 hf 是否大于逸出功 W}\n    C --&gt;|是| D[电子逸出, 产生光电流]\n    C --&gt;|否| E[无论光多强都无电子逸出]\n    D --&gt; F[电子最大动能 = hf - W]</pre><p>经典波动理论与爱因斯坦的光量子假说，对光电效应给出了截然不同的预言。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>实验现象</th>\n<th>经典波动理论的预言</th>\n<th>实际观测 / 光量子解释</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>是否有截止频率</td>\n<td>无；只要光够强就能打出电子</td>\n<td>有；低于某频率无论多强都无电子</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电子动能与什么有关</td>\n<td>与光强有关</td>\n<td>只与光的频率有关</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>光强的作用</td>\n<td>决定能否打出电子</td>\n<td>只决定电子数量，不决定动能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>响应时间</td>\n<td>弱光需积累，有延迟</td>\n<td>几乎瞬时，无可测延迟</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"实验现象与经典理论的困境\">实验现象与经典理论的困境</h2><p>光电效应由赫兹（Heinrich Hertz）于 1887 年偶然发现，随后勒纳德（Philipp Lenard）做了系统研究。实验揭示出几个让经典物理学家困惑的事实：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>存在一个<strong>截止频率</strong>：当入射光频率低于某个阈值时，无论把光调得多亮、照多久，都打不出一个电子。</li>\n<li>被打出电子的<strong>最大动能只取决于光的频率</strong>，与光的强度无关。</li>\n<li>增大光强只会增加打出电子的<strong>数量</strong>，不改变单个电子的能量。</li>\n<li>一旦频率足够，电子的逸出几乎是<strong>瞬时</strong>的，没有可观测的延迟。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>按照麦克斯韦的波动理论，光是连续的电磁波，能量随光强增大而增大。那么足够强的低频光也应能逐渐把能量&quot;喂&quot;给电子使其逸出，且响应应有延迟。这与实验完全矛盾。</p>\n<h2 id=\"爱因斯坦的光量子假说\">爱因斯坦的光量子假说</h2><p>爱因斯坦的解法借鉴了普朗克（Max Planck）1900 年为解释黑体辐射而引入的能量量子化思想，并将其推进了一大步。普朗克认为能量量子化只是物质振子吸收和发射能量的方式，爱因斯坦则大胆主张：<strong>光本身就由一份份不可分割的能量子构成</strong>，每一份的能量为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E = hf</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 是普朗克常数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 是光的频率。</p>\n<p>在这一图景下，一个电子要逸出金属，必须从单个光量子那里一次性获得足够能量。如果光量子的能量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">hf</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 小于金属的逸出功 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>，电子就无法逃逸——这正是截止频率的来源。截止频率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">hf_0 = W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"光电方程与密立根的验证\">光电方程与密立根的验证</h2><p>由能量守恒，逸出电子的最大动能等于光子能量减去逸出功：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi><mi>f</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{k,\\max} = hf - W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这就是著名的爱因斯坦光电方程。它预言电子最大动能与频率成线性关系，斜率恰为普朗克常数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span>，且与金属种类无关。</p>\n<p>起初许多物理学家不相信光量子假说，连普朗克都对此持保留态度。美国物理学家密立根（Robert Millikan）原本想用实验<strong>反驳</strong>爱因斯坦，却在 1916 年前后以极高精度证实了光电方程，并由测得的直线斜率精确地确定了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 的数值。密立根本人也因此（连同电子电荷的测量）于 1923 年获诺贝尔奖。一次意在证伪的实验，反而成了最有力的证明。</p>\n<h2 id=\"诺贝尔奖与量子理论的奠基\">诺贝尔奖与量子理论的奠基</h2><p>1922 年 11 月 9 日，瑞典皇家科学院宣布将 1921 年度（前一年因故保留）诺贝尔物理学奖授予爱因斯坦，理由是&quot;表彰他对理论物理学的贡献，特别是发现了光电效应的定律&quot;。颁奖词刻意避开了仍有争议的相对论，只提光电效应。当时爱因斯坦正在前往日本的旅途中，未能出席颁奖典礼，由德国驻瑞典大使代领。</p>\n<p>光量子的概念后来被命名为&quot;光子&quot;（1926 年由化学家路易斯提出该词）。它确立了光的波粒二象性：光既能像波一样干涉衍射，又能像粒子一样把能量整份地交给电子。这一思想是量子力学的基石之一，也启发了德布罗意提出物质波、康普顿发现光子散射等后续突破。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>光电效应论文发表于 1905 年 3 月，是爱因斯坦自认&quot;最革命&quot;的奇迹年工作。</li>\n<li>经典波动理论无法解释截止频率、动能只依赖频率等实验事实。</li>\n<li>爱因斯坦提出光由能量子组成，单个量子能量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E = hf</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span>，并写出光电方程 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi><mi>f</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{k,\\max} = hf - W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>密立根原想反驳，却以精密实验证实了该方程并测定普朗克常数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>这项工作为爱因斯坦赢得 1921 年诺贝尔物理学奖（1922 年颁发），并成为量子理论的奠基之一。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"相关阅读\">相关阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"brownian-motion-statistical\">布朗运动与统计物理</a>：同年 5 月的姊妹篇——把统计方法用于分子实在性，与本篇同属奇迹年。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../legacy-and-recognition/nobel-prize-and-honors\">诺贝尔奖与荣誉</a>：本篇正是官方获奖理由；为何相对论反而落选，曲折全在那里。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"光电效应","id":"光电效应"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"实验现象与经典理论的困境","id":"实验现象与经典理论的困境"},{"level":2,"text":"爱因斯坦的光量子假说","id":"爱因斯坦的光量子假说"},{"level":2,"text":"光电方程与密立根的验证","id":"光电方程与密立根的验证"},{"level":2,"text":"诺贝尔奖与量子理论的奠基","id":"诺贝尔奖与量子理论的奠基"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"相关阅读","id":"相关阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"质能等价 E=mc²","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/albert-einstein/major-works/physics-revolutions/mass-energy-equivalence"},"next":{"title":"布朗运动与统计物理","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/albert-einstein/major-works/quantum-and-statistical/brownian-motion-statistical"}}